  triage:title "No boundary TOML record for new resolver/CrossHostDelivery traits" ;
  triage:description "The new resolver traits (RemoteEndpointResolver, DaemonRemoteEndpointResolver, CrossHostDelivery) have no boundary TOML record, leaving the new boundary mechanically unguarded against future lint enforcement." ;
